12. Research Program

Stage I — Formalization

State variables, transition dynamics, unrolled SCM (§3, §5).

Stage II — Minimal PoC (2–3 weeks)

· Replicate Huginn inference loop on Llama-3-8B with K = 4; verify KV-cache carry across turns.
· Measure baseline I(Y_B; \text{residual stream}).

Stage III — Encoder + SAE + DAS (2 weeks)

· Train g_O LoRA on NegotiationToM BDI labels.
· Train TopK SAEs on layers 20–24 (16k dict, L_0 = 32).
· Run DAS rotation search.

Stage IV — Causal intervention (2 weeks)

· Counterfactual activation patching: cooperative → competitive.
· Path patching to isolate O_t \to a_t.
· Measure \Delta_a on forced-choice classifier.

Stage V — Benchmarking

FANToM-extended, irony, NegotiationToM, strategic ambiguity, LIFELONG-SOTOPA slice.

Stage VI — Biological comparison

Only after the artificial system is experimentally characterized.

