13. Ethical and Conceptual Clarification

· HIL does not address consciousness or phenomenology. Claim is about access and causal role, in Dehaene's sense.
· Avoid "internal loop" language that implies a homunculus. Use re-entry in Edelman's sense (reentrant signaling).
· Dual-use: improved Other-modeling enables manipulation (negotiation, persuasion). Mitigation: transparency of O_t via DAS-decoded subspace reporting.

